[E-PROOF-ONLY] Error: `reify` can only be used in a proof
   ╭─[ reject/reify-data-def.sw:7:3 ]
   │
 7 │   match reify t with
   │   ──────┬──────  
   │         ╰──────── this declaration computes data, so this would run
